[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14717.67, "timestamp": "04:05:17", "text": "哦，天哪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14720.229, "timestamp": "04:05:20", "text": "我又回来了。 迪奥，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14723.03, "timestamp": "04:05:23", "text": "抱歉我耽搁了这么久。 我想我，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14726.71, "timestamp": "04:05:26", "text": "我想我吃了……哦我的天哪，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14735.11, "timestamp": "04:05:35", "text": "我已经吃饱了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14743.554, "timestamp": "04:05:43", "text": "我一路狂奔，吃了很多东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14745.11, "timestamp": "04:05:45", "text": "[清嗓子]，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14750.309, "timestamp": "04:05:50", "text": "还在保温瓶里装了热水。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14754.229, "timestamp": "04:05:54", "text": "嗯，我准备了一些橙子和一些水果，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14759.429, "timestamp": "04:05:59", "text": "这样我晚上做这件事的时候就可以边吃边吃了"}]